OL,3,GNEWSACyclist, 34, dies after crash with
OL,4,Acar
OL,5,
OL,6,FA cyclist has died following a crash
OL,7,Fwith a car in Hull, police have said.
OL,9,FThe collision happened on Princes
OL,10,FAvenue, south of the junction with
OL,11,FWestbourne Avenue, at about 11:00 GMT
OL,12,Fon Monday, Humberside Police said.
OL,14,FThe cyclist, a 34-year-old man, was
OL,15,Ftaken to hospital with life-threatening
OL,16,Finjuries and died a short time later,
OL,17,Fthe force said.
OL,23,APub: 17-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
